      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Kohsuke Kawaguchi talks about &lt;a href=&#34;https://hudson.dev.java.net/&#34;&gt;Hudson, a continuous integration system&lt;/a&gt; that he&amp;#39;s been developing for the last few years. It is a web application that continuously builds your project and keeps track of what&amp;#39;s happening.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A part of the talk will be about the general introduction of it and what it can do.&#xA;A demo will be shown, and a highlight of most interesting technologies behind Hudson.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;These include the plugin system, the remoting infrastructure, the way distributed builds are handled, how installation is simplified, and the&#xA;avoidance of cryptic URLs in a very REST-full web application.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
